INSERT INTO prelims_pyqs (exam_year, subject, subtopic, difficulty, question_number, question_text, correct_answer, embedding, search_vector) VALUES (
    2025, 'Polity', 'Constitutional Provisions', 'moderate', 55,
    'medium
Q55. Consider the following pairs:
Provision in the Constitution of India : Stated under
I. Separation of Judiciary from the Executive in the public services of the State : The Directive
Principles of the State Policy
II. Valuing and preserving of the rich heritage of our composite culture : The Fundamental Duties
III. Prohibition of employment of children below the age of 14 years in factories : The
Fundamental Rights
How many of the above pairs are correctly matched?
(a) Only one
