    to_tsvector('english', 'Geography ' || 'Astronomy & Earth–Sun System ' || 'Consider the following statements:
I. Anadyr in Siberia and Nome in Alaska are a few kilometres from each other, but when people
are waking up and getting set for breakfast in these cities, it would be different days.
II. When it is Monday in Anadyr, it is Tuesday in Nome.
Which of the statements given above is/are correct?
(a) I only
(b) II only
(c) Both I and II
(d) Neither I nor II')
);

