    2025, 'Current Affairs', 'International Relations & Treaties', 'moderate', 95,
    'Consider the following statements regarding AI Action Summit held in Grand Palais, Paris in
February 2025 :
I. Co-chaired with India, the event builds on the advances made at the Bletchley Park Summit
held in 2023 and the Seoul Summit held in 2024.
II. Along with other countries, US and UK also signed the declaration on inclusive and sustainable
AI.
Which of the statements given above is/are correct?
(a) I only
