    to_tsvector('english', 'Indian Polity ' || 'Social Justice & Vulnerable Sections ' || 'Consider the following statements regarding ''Nari Shakti Vandan Adhiniyam'' :
1. Provisions will come into effect from the 18th Lok Sabha.
2. This will be in force for 15 years after becoming an Act.
3. There are provisions for the reservation of seats for Scheduled Castes Women within the quota
reserved for the Scheduled Castes.
Which of the statements given above are correct?
(a) 1, 2 and 3
(b) 1 and 2 only
(c) 2 and 3 only
(d) 1 and 3 only')
);

