    to_tsvector('english', 'Current Affairs ' || 'Business & Economy ' || 'Consider the following statements: Statement-I:
Recently, Venezuela has achieved a rapid recovery from its economic crisis and succeeded in
preventing its people from fleeing/emigrating to other countries. Statement-II:
Venezuela has the world''s largest oil reserves. Which one of the following is correct in respect of
the above statements?
(a) Both Statement-I and Statement-II are correct and Statement-II explains Statement-I
(b) Both Statement-I and Statement-II are correct, but Statement-II does not explain Statement-I
(c) Statement-I is correct, but Statement-II is incorrect
(d) Statement-I is incorrect, but Statement-II is correct')
);

