    to_tsvector('english', 'Indian Economy ' || 'Infrastructure & Industry ' || 'Consider the following statements with reference to India :
1. According to the ''Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises Development (MSMED) Act, 2006'', the
''medium enterprises'' are those with investments in plant and machinery between ₹ 15 crore and
₹ 25 crore.
2. All bank loans to the Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises qualify under the priority sector.
Which of the statements given above is/are correct?
(a) 1 only
(b) 2 only
(c) Both 1 and 2
(d) Neither 1 nor 2')
);

