    to_tsvector('english', 'Environment & Ecology ' || 'Water & Wetland Conservation ' || '"If rainforests and tropical forests are the lungs of the Earth, then surely wetlands function
as its kidneys." Which one of the following functions of wetlands best reflects the above
statement?
(a) The water cycle in wetlands involves surface runoff, subsoil percolation and evaporation.
(b) Algae form the nutrient base upon which fish, crustaceans, molluscs, birds, reptiles and mammals
thrive.
(c) Wetlands play a vital role in maintaining sedimentation balance and soil stabilization.
(d) Aquatic plants absorb heavy metals and excess nutrients.')
);

