INSERT INTO prelims_pyqs (exam_year, subject, subtopic, difficulty, question_number, question_text, correct_answer, embedding, search_vector) VALUES (
    2022, 'Current Affairs', 'Business & Economy', 'moderate', 67,
    'Consider the following statements:
1. Vietnam has been one of the fastest growing economies in the world in the recent years.
2. Vietnam is led by a multi-party political system.
3. Vietnam''s economic growth is linked to its integration with global supply chains and focus on
exports.
4. For a long time Vietnam''s low labour costs and stable exchange rates have attracted global
manufacturers.
5. Vietnam has the most productive e-service sector in the Indo-Pacific region.
Which of the statements given above are correct?
(a) 2 and 4
