    to_tsvector('english', 'Science & Technology ' || 'Defence Technology ' || 'Which one of the following statements best describes the ‘Polar Code’?
(a) It is the international code of safety for ships operating in polar waters.
(b) It is the agreement of the countries around the North Pole regarding the demarcation of their
