    to_tsvector('english', 'Medieval History ' || 'Bhakti Movement ' || 'The world''s second tallest statue in sitting pose of Ramanuja was inaugurated by the Prime
Minister of India at Hyderabad recently. Which one of the following statements correctly
represents the teachings of Ramanuja?
