    to_tsvector('english', 'Indian Polity ' || 'Parliament & State Legislatures ' || 'With reference to the Legislative Assembly of a State in India, consider the following
statements:
1. The Governor makes a customary address to Members of the House at the commencement of
the first session of the year.
2. When a State Legislature does not have a rule on a particular matter, it follows the Lok Sabha
rule on that matter.
