    to_tsvector('english', 'Indian Polity ' || 'Judiciary ' || 'With reference to the Constitution of India, consider the following statements:
1. No High Court shall have the jurisdiction to declare any Central law to be constitutionally
invalid.
2. An amendment to the Constitution of India cannot be called in question by the Supreme Court
of India.
Which of the statements given above is/are correct?
