    to_tsvector('english', 'Science & Technology ' || 'Space Technology & Astronomy ' || 'With reference to the Indian Regional Navigation Satellite System (IRNSS), consider the
following statements:
1. IRNSS has three satellites in geostationary and four satellites in geosynchronous orbits.
2. IRNSS covers entire India and about 5500 sq. km beyond its borders.
3. India will have its own satellite navigation system with full global coverage by the middle of
2019.
Which of the statements given above is/are correct?
(a) 1 only
(b) 1 and 2 only
(c) 2 and 3 only
(d) None')
);

