    2017, 'Environment & Ecology', 'Climate Change & Greenhouse Gases', 'moderate', 25,
    'In the context of mitigating the impending global warming due to anthropogenic emissions
of carbon dioxide, which of the following can be the potential sites for carbon sequestration?
