0]',
    to_tsvector('english', 'Indian Polity ' || 'Union & State Executive ' || 'Out of the following statements, choose the one that brings out the principle underlying the
Cabinet form of Government:
(a) An arrangement for minimizing the criticism against the Government whose responsibilities are
complex and hard to carry out to the satisfaction of all.
(b) A mechanism for speeding up the activities of the Government whose responsibilities are increasing
day by day.
(c) A mechanism of parliamentary democracy for ensuring collective responsibility of the
Government to the people.
(d) A device for strengthening the hands of the head of the Government whose hold over the people is in a
state of decline.')
);

