INSERT INTO prelims_pyqs (exam_year, subject, subtopic, difficulty, question_number, question_text, correct_answer, embedding, search_vector) VALUES (
    2016, 'Indian Economy', 'International Institutions & Reports', 'moderate', 15,
    'With reference to the International Monetary and Financial Committee (IMFC), consider the
following statements:
1. IMFC discusses matters of concern affecting the global economy, and advises the International
Monetary Fund (IMF) on the direction of its work.
2. The World Bank participates as observer in IMFC''s meetings.
Which of the statements given above is/are correct?
(a) 1 only
