    to_tsvector('english', 'Environment & Ecology ' || 'Sustainable Agriculture & Forestry ' || 'What are the significances of a practical approach to sugarcane production known as
''Sustainable Sugarcane Initiative''?
1. Seed cost is very low in this compared to the conventional method of cultivation.
2. Drip irrigation can be practiced very effectively in this.
3. There is no application of chemical/inorganic fertilizers at all in this.
4. The scope for intercropping is more in this compared to the conventional method of
cultivation.
