    2012, 'Environment & Ecology', 'Biodiversity & Conservation', 'moderate', 95,
    'What is the difference between the antelopes Oryx and Chiru?
(a) Oryx is adapted to live in hot and arid areas whereas Chiru is adapted to live in steppes and
