    to_tsvector('english', 'Indian Economy ' || 'Inflation & Price Indices ' || 'A rapid increase in the rate of inflation is sometimes attributed to the "base effect". What is
"base effect" ?
(a) It is the impact of drastic deficiency in supply due to failure of crops
(b) It is the impact of the surge in demand due to rapid economic growth
