    to_tsvector('english', 'Environment & Ecology ' || 'Biogeochemical Cycles & Earth Systems ' || 'Human activities in the recent past have caused the increased concentration of carbon
dioxide in the atmosphere, but a lot of it does not remain in the lower atmosphere because of
