    to_tsvector('english', 'Indian Polity ' || 'Social Justice & Vulnerable Sections ' || 'In India, if a religious sect/community is given the status of a national minority, what special
advantages is it entitled to?
1. It can establish and administer exclusive educational institutions.
2. The President of India automatically nominates a representative of the community to Lok
Sabha.
3. It can derive benefits from the Prime Minister’s 15-Point Programme.
Which of the statements given above is/are correct?
(a) 1 only
(b) 2 and 3 only
(c) 1 and 3 only
(d) 1, 2 and 3')
);

