    2011, 'Modern History', 'Peasant, Tribal & Labour Movements', 'moderate', 55,
    'Which amongst the following provided a common factor for tribal insurrection in India in
the 19th century ?
(a) Introduction of a new system of land revenue and taxation of tribal products
