    to_tsvector('english', 'Modern History ' || 'Peasant, Tribal & Labour Movements ' || 'Which amongst the following provided a common factor for tribal insurrection in India in
the 19th century ?
(a) Introduction of a new system of land revenue and taxation of tribal products
