    to_tsvector('english', 'Current Affairs ' || 'International Organisations & Groupings ' || 'Consider the following statements:
1. North Atlantic Co-operation Council (NACC) is the name of the new organization which has
replaced the North Atlantic Treaty Organization (NATO).
2. The United States of America and the United Kingdom became members of NATO when it was
formed in 1949.
