    to_tsvector('english', 'Science & Technology ' || 'Space Technology & Astronomy ' || 'Consider the following statements in respect of India''s advanced satellite INSAT–4A :
1. INSAT–4A was launched in December, 2005 from New Mexico.
2. The European commercial launch service provider Arianespace was associated with the launch
of INSAT–4A.
