    to_tsvector('english', 'Indian Polity ' || 'Social Justice & Vulnerable Sections ' || 'Consider the following statements:
1. Free and compulsory education to the children of 6-14 years age group by the State was made a
Fundamental Right by the 76th Amendment to the Constitution of India.
2. Sarva Shiksha Abhiyan seeks to provide computer education even in rural areas.
3. Education was included in the Concurrent List by the 42nd Amendment, 1976 to the
Constitution of India.
Which of the statements given above are correct?
(a) 1, 2 and 3
(b) 1 and 2, only
(c) 2 and 3, only
(d) 1 and 3, only')
);

