    2006, 'Current Affairs', 'Indian Government Schemes & Initiatives', 'moderate', 118,
    'With reference to the Government of India’s various programmes, what is Nirmal Gram
Puraskar?
(a) It is an incentive scheme of scholarships for the single girl child in families in villages.
(b) It is an incentive scheme of scholarships for female sportspersons from villages who represent their
