    to_tsvector('english', 'Indian Economy ' || 'International Institutions & Reports ' || 'Consider the following statements :
1. Poverty Reduction and Growth Facility (PRGF) has been established by the International
Development Association (IDA) to provide further assistance to low-income countries facing high
level of indebtedness.
