    2005, 'Science & Technology', 'Quantitative Aptitude', 'moderate', 96,
    'Left pan of a faulty balance weighs 100 gram more than its right pan. A shopkeeper keeps
the weight measure in the left pan while buying goods but keeps it in the right pan while selling
his goods. He uses only 1 kg weight measure. If he sells his goods at the listed cost price, what is
his gain?
