    to_tsvector('english', 'Modern History ' || 'Early Nationalism & Indian National Congress (1885-1915) ' || 'Consider the following statements:
1. The First Session of the Indian National Congress was held in Calcutta.
2. The Second Session of the Indian National Congress was held under the presidentship of
Dadabhai Naoroji.
3. Both Indian National Congress and Muslim League held their sessions at Lucknow in 1916 and
concluded the Lucknow Pact.
Which of these statements given above is/are correct?
(a) 1 and 2
(b) 2 only
(c) 2 and 3
(d) 3 only')
);

