Age Pension but not getting pension can get 10 kg of food grains per person per month at BPL rates.
(c) Ministry of Social Justice and Empowerment has a scheme in which indigent people living in welfare
institutions like orphanages are given 15 kg of food grains per person per month at BPL rates.
