    to_tsvector('english', 'Modern History ' || 'Gandhian Mass Movements (1915-1942) ' || 'Consider the following events during India’s freedom struggle:
1. Chauri-Chaura Outrage
2. Minto-Morley Reforms
3. Dandi March
4. Montagu-Chelmsford Reforms
