    2004, 'Science & Technology', 'Energy & Environment', 'easy', 124,
    'Match List I (Fuel Gases) with List II (Major Constituents) and select the correct answer
using the codes given below:
List I
(A) CNG
(B) Coal gas
(C) LPG
(D) Water gas
List II
1. Carbon monoxide, Hydrogen
2. Butane, Propane
3. Methane, Ethane
4. Hydrogen, Methane, Carbon monoxide
Codes:
(a) A 2   B 1   C 3   D 4
