    to_tsvector('english', 'Indian Economy ' || 'Infrastructure & Industry ' || 'With reference to power sector in India consider the following statements:
1. Rural electrification has been treated as a Basic Minimum Service under the Prime Minister’s
Gramodaya Yojana.
