    2001, 'Indian Economy', 'National Income & Economic Growth', 'moderate', 114,
    'The following table shows the percentage change in the consumption of electricity by five
towns P, Q, R, S, T from 1986 to 1988:
Town   Per cent change from 1986 to 1987   From 1987 to 1988
P   +8   −18
Q   +15  −11
R   +6   +9
S   −7   −5
T   +13  −6
