    to_tsvector('english', 'Indian Economy ' || 'Infrastructure & Industry ' || 'Consider the following statements: Industrial development in India, to an extent, is
constrained by
I. Lack of adequate entrepreneurship and leadership in business.
II. Lack of savings to invest.
III. Lack of technology, skills and infrastructure.
