    1999, 'Indian Economy', 'Human Development, Poverty & Employment Schemes', 'moderate', 28,
    'The Employment Assurance Scheme envisages financial assistance to rural areas for
guaranteeing employment to at least
(a) 50 per cent of the men and women seeking jobs in rural areas
