    1998, 'Science & Technology', 'Quantitative Aptitude', 'moderate', 142,
    'In a family, a couple has a son and a daughter. The age of the father is three times that of
his daughter and the age of the son is half of his mother. The wife is nine years younger to her
husband and the brother is seven years older than his sister. What is the age of the mother?
(a) 40 years
