    to_tsvector('english', 'Art & Culture ' || 'Theatre & Cinema ' || 'The following advertisement appeared in the Times of India dated 7th August:
"THE MARVEL OF THE CENTURY
THE WONDER OF THE WORLD
LIVING PHOTOGRAPHIC PICTURES IN LIFE-SIZED REPRODUCTIONS BY MESSERS LUMIERE
BROTHERS CINEMATOGRAPHIE
A FEW EXHIBITIONS WILL BE GIVEN AT WATSON''S HOTEL TONIGHT".
It appeared in the year —
(a) 1931
(b) 1929
(c) 1921
(d) 1896')
);

