INSERT INTO prelims_pyqs (exam_year, subject, subtopic, difficulty, question_number, question_text, correct_answer, embedding, search_vector) VALUES (
    1995, 'Science & Technology', 'Quantitative Aptitude', 'moderate', 3897,
    'difficult
Q150. A person earns Rs 2000 per month over and above his salary as additional charge
allowance. However, 30 % of this additional income will be deducted as additional income tax at
source. If the person would deposit Rs 1000 per month in a long-term saving fetching 12 %
interest, his tax liability on the additional allowance would reduce to 10 %. What is the effective
interest for this person for money invested in the long-term savings scheme?
(a) 12 %
